  "title": "Senjou no Valkyria 3: Unrecorded Chronicles - Tagatame no Juusou",
  "justification": "Volumes 1 and 2 of \"Tagatame no Juusou\" (2011-04-13 and 2011-06-29) are TVDB season 0 episodes 11 and 12 \"Unrecorded Chronicles: The Wound Taken for Someone's Sake (1)\" and \"(2)\" (2011-04-13, 2011-06-29), and TMDB 24392 season 0 episodes 10 and 11 \"Senjou no Valkyria 3 - OVA 1\" and \"OVA 2\". The row sent them to TVDB episodes 10 \"Extra\" and 11, and TMDB placed them on the \"Gallian Chronicles\" shorts 1-2. Specials S1-S2 \"Challenge from Sega! Part 1/2\" have no TVDB or TMDB episode; by default they fell on \"Gallian Chronicles 1-2\" of the first series (AniDB 6244). They are unmapped.",
